    "synopsis": "Hailing from a rural town, Meiko Morita moves to the bright city of Tokyo to enroll in the prestigious Amamiya Girls' Academy. Though she expects the institution's dormitory to be full of glamor, Meiko discovers that her new home is actually a manga cafe where its residents run the business by doing community service.\n\nAlthough inept with modern technology, Meiko is warmly welcomed by the other residents: Rie Amamiya, the head of the dormitory; Marika Suzuki, a popular streamer; and Neo Nakano, an aspiring professional gamer. Together, the girls navigate through school and run the manga cafe, never forgetting to enjoy every second of every day.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]",
